---
// Functional options pattern (#11): zero-value ambiguity in Config vs Option closure chain in NewServer.
// Icons: DiagramIcon (question, config, shield, timer, server). Motion: fm-dot (the options value passing down the chain).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 344;

function arrow(x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number) {
  const a = Math.atan2(y2 - y1, x2 - x1);
  const len = 8;
  const p1 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a - 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a - 0.45)];
  const p2 = [x2 - len * Math.cos(a + 0.45), y2 - len * Math.sin(a + 0.45)];
  return {
    line: `M ${x1} ${y1} L ${x2 - 6 * Math.cos(a)} ${y2 - 6 * Math.sin(a)}`,
    head: `${x2},${y2} ${p1[0].toFixed(1)},${p1[1].toFixed(1)} ${p2[0].toFixed(1)},${p2[1].toFixed(1)}`,
  };
}

const s1 = arrow(226, 206, 256, 206);
const s2 = arrow(462, 206, 492, 206);
const s3 = arrow(698, 206, 728, 206);
---
<figure class="gp12e">
  <div class="gp12e-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: a plain Config struct cannot tell an omitted port apart from Port set to 0. Bottom: NewServer starts with default options, runs each Option closure in order to validate and update fields, and returns *Server or stops on the first error.">
    {/* Top: why plain Config{Port: int} is ambiguous */}
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Zero-value ambiguity in a plain Config struct</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Nhập nhằng zero value khi dùng Config struct thuần</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="44" width="230" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="135" y="71" text-anchor="middle" class="b">Config{'{}'}  -&gt;  Port: 0</text>

    <rect x="270" y="44" width="230" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="385" y="71" text-anchor="middle" class="b">Config{'{Port: 0}'}  -&gt;  Port: 0</text>

    <DiagramIcon name="question" x={534} y={68} size={26} />
    <text x="560" y="64" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Identical in memory: cannot distinguish</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Giống hệt trong bộ nhớ: không phân biệt được</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="560" y="84" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>"use default 8080" vs "pick random port 0"</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>"dùng mặc định 8080" hay "cố tình chọn cổng 0"</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="108" y2="108" class="rule" />

    {/* Bottom: Functional options flow */}
    <text x="20" y="136" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. Functional options: NewServer("127.0.0.1", WithPort(0), WithReadTimeout(5*time.Second))</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Functional options: NewServer("127.0.0.1", WithPort(0), WithReadTimeout(5*time.Second))</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="156" width="206" height="100" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="36" y="182" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Default options</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. options mặc định</tspan>
    </text>
    <DiagramIcon name="config" x={196} y={200} size={26} />
    <text x="36" y="206" class="m">port = nil  (8080)</text>
    <text x="36" y="228" class="m">readTimeout = 10s</text>

    <g><path d={s1.line} class="ln" /><polygon points={s1.head} class="ar" /></g>

    <rect x="256" y="156" width="206" height="100" rx="6" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="shield" x={432} y={200} size={26} />
    <text x="272" y="182" class="b">2. WithPort(0)</text>
    <text x="272" y="206" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>checks port &gt;= 0</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm tra port &gt;= 0</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="272" y="228" class="m">sets o.port = &amp;0</text>

    <g><path d={s2.line} class="ln" /><polygon points={s2.head} class="ar" /></g>

    <rect x="492" y="156" width="206" height="100" rx="6" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="timer" x={668} y={200} size={26} />
    <text x="508" y="182" class="b">3. WithReadTimeout(5s)</text>
    <text x="508" y="206" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>checks d &gt; 0</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm tra d &gt; 0</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="508" y="228" class="m">sets o.readTimeout = 5s</text>

    <g><path d={s3.line} class="ln" /><polygon points={s3.head} class="ar" /></g>

    <rect x="728" y="156" width="152" height="100" rx="6" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={854} y={200} size={26} />
    <text x="744" y="182" class="b">*Server</text>
    <circle class="dot fm-dot" r="4"><animateMotion dur="4s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M123,147 L804,147" /></circle>
    <text x="744" y="206" class="m">port: 54321</text>
    <text x="744" y="228" class="m">timeout: 5s</text>

    <rect x="20" y="276" width="860" height="44" rx="6" class="hot" />
    <text x="36" y="303" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>If WithPort(-1) runs, the option returns an error right away and NewServer stops before building *Server.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Nếu truyền WithPort(-1), closure trả về lỗi ngay và NewServer dừng luôn trước khi tạo *Server.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Each <code>With...</code> helper captures its argument in an <code>Option</code> closure that validates and updates the unexported <code>options</code> struct, keeping zero-arg defaults clean (<code>NewServer("127.0.0.1")</code>) while telling <code>0</code> apart from omitted.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mỗi hàm <code>With...</code> giữ tham số trong một closure <code>Option</code> để kiểm tra hợp lệ và cập nhật struct <code>options</code> nội bộ, vừa cho phép gọi mặc định gọn (<code>NewServer("127.0.0.1")</code>), vừa phân biệt rõ số <code>0</code> với trường bỏ trống.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp12e { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp12e-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp12e svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp12e text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp12e .h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp12e .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp12e .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .gp12e .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .gp12e .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp12e .hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gp12e .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp12e .ar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp12e .dot { fill: var(--gold); stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp12e .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp12e figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
